                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So, this is my first time doing this...\nI can't really recommend this visual novel at all.  It's a bit misleading with the 'free to play' as it's just the [b]prologue[/b], which is about a few minutes. Of course to combat this, they did let you, the player, peek previews in selected routes' first chapter. Otherwise, you're looking at 64$ bucks in [i]DLC alone[/i]. I doubt they'll do any sales anymore. \n\nOther than that, the writing is okay-ish. Nothing noteworthy.",
